OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration as months of roadworks
OL,4,Abegin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer says it is frustrating that
OL,7,Ftwo months of roadworks have started
OL,8,Fnext to his land during one of his
OL,9,Fbusiest months of the year.
OL,11,FPhil Collins, who runs a pumpkin
OL,12,Fpicking site near the A3102, said the
OL,13,Fweek leading up to Halloween is his
OL,14,Fsecond-busiest time of the year.
OL,16,FBut he is concerned about losing trade
OL,17,Fas roadworks on the A3102/A342 junction
OL,18,Fat Bromham began earlier and will
OL,19,Fcontinue until December.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
